# Baseline security headers for every response.
#
# Deliberately NOT a full Content-Security-Policy yet: the pages carry inline
# <style> and <script>, so a script-src/style-src policy would need either
# 'unsafe-inline' (which buys nothing) or those blocks moved out to files and
# every page retested. The directives below are the ones that cannot break a
# working page, so they are worth having now.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
